      },
      "message": "Release v1.14.0 - Hierarchical Multi-Agent Orchestration & CLI Enforcement\n\n## Version 1.14.0\n\nUpdated CHANGELOG.md, package.json, and README.md to reflect version 1.14.0.\n\n### Highlights\n\n**🎯 Major Feature: Hierarchical Multi-Agent Orchestration System**\n- Complete PM orchestrator (csprojecttask) that coordinates specialist sub-agents\n- State management with Python CLI tools (state_manager.py, topic_manager.py)\n- Interactive multi-topic dashboard with real-time progress tracking\n- Workaround for Claude Code limitation (agents cannot invoke other agents)\n- 3-phase workflow: PM prepares → user approves → main executes\n\n**🌐 Professional Website Templates (3 Complete Templates)**\n- Corporate Professional (enterprise-grade, blue/gray)\n- Startup Modern (vibrant, gradient-heavy, purple/pink/orange)\n- Minimalist Clean (Swiss design, typography-focused, black/white/red)\n- Production-ready: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, full documentation\n\n**🔧 CLI Modern Tools Enforcement**\n- Mandatory pre-flight check with visual decision tree\n- Silent enforcement (find → Glob, grep → Grep, cat → Read, ls → eza)\n- Updated CLAUDE.md with mandatory bash command checking\n\n**🤖 New Agents Added**\n- single-page-website-builder (HTML/CSS/JS expert)\n- feature-comparison-analyst (capability analysis)\n- market-research-analyst (market positioning)\n- pricing-research-analyst (pricing strategy)\n\n**🐛 Critical Fixes**\n- Fixed state management: sub-agents now properly update task states\n- Fixed dashboard integration: shows 100% completion correctly\n- Fixed missing create_state_file step in orchestration template\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
